# Thought Shucker {1}{U}, 1/3: "Threshold — {1}{U}: Put a +1/+1 counter on this creature and draw a card. Activate only if there are seven
# or more cards in your graveyard and only once" (CR 207.2c, 602.5b). On turn 3 Bot1 has six cards in its graveyard (Black Lotus, Thought
# Scour and its two milled Islands, two Opts) and two mana in its pool: the ability is refused. A seventh card (Opt) allows it, on turn 5
# it is activated (2/4, one card drawn), and a second activation with mana to spare is refused, as it may be activated only once: on turn 7 too (CR 602.5b, "only
# once" is not "once each turn").

